   ```

   But the "todo titled is completed" steps now use the toggle click (which fires the app's toggle handler). The toggle handler saves to localStorage and calls render. But then the "Clear completed" button is clicked. The clearCompleted handler reads from the closure's todos array, which was set by `render()` reading `getTodos()` from localStorage. So it should work...

